    "name": "Exmoor National Park",
    "region": "U.K.",
    "description": "Located in the southwest of England in the counties of Somerset and Devon, Exmoor National Park enjoys some of the darkest skies in the country yet offers relatively easy access from urban hubs. Dark sky awareness in the park bloomed in 2009 with a variety of programs on astronomy and conservation held during UNESCO’s International Year of Astronomy .",
