    "name": "Tāhuna Glenorchy",
    "region": "New Zealand",
    "description": "The Tāhuna Glenorchy Dark Sky Sanctuary is located at the Head of Lake Whakatipu in the Queenstown Lakes District of New Zealand. Situated largely within the Te Wāhipounamu UNESCO World Heritage Site in Tititea Mt. Aspiring National Park, the Tāhuna Glenorchy Dark Sky Sanctuary encompasses 200,000 ha of land in the Southern Alps with over seventy-five percent of the sanctuary area within Te Wāhipounamu.",
