    "name": "Weißbach Nature Park and Municipality",
    "region": "Austria",
    "description": "The Weißbach Nature Park municipality is located in a broad valley of the Saalach Valley between Saalfelden and Lofer at an elevation of 666 meters above sea level, surrounded by a ring of the most beautiful mountains: the foothills of the Steinernes Meer, the Leoganger and Loferer Steinberge, the Reiter Alpe, and the Hochkalter Group. Here, at the former border station of the Hirschbichl Pass (1,148 m), Salzburg and Bavaria meet.",
    "category": "Community",
    "officialUrl": "https://darksky.org/places/weisbach-nature-park-and-municipality/"
